# The player's other controls on The Quiet Shelf, three two-second chapters:
# chapter skips, the thirty-second skips and the page keys, volume, the
# sleep timer at the end of a chapter, switching Bluetooth off and back on
# by pressing Play, and the place kept across a restart.
wait-for Audiobooks
tap The Quiet Shelf
wait-for Now playing
tap Pause
wait-for Play
tap Next chapter
wait-for 2 of 3
tap Previous chapter
wait-for 1 of 3
tap Forward 30 sec
wait-for 0:06 of 0:06
tap Back 30 sec
wait-for 0:00 of 0:06
page next
wait-for 0:06 of 0:06
page back
wait-for 0:00 of 0:06
tap Louder
wait-for 80%
tap Quieter
wait-for 70%
clean
shot audiobook-controls
tap Sleep
wait-for Sleep timer
expect Not on a timer
tap At the end of this chapter
wait-for Now playing
expect Pauses at the end of this chapter
tap Sleep
wait-for Sleep timer
tap Not on a timer
wait-for Now playing
expect-missing Pauses at the end
# With Bluetooth switched off the output says so, and Play turns it on and
# finds the headphones again.
tap Bluetooth audio output
wait-for Bluetooth audio
tap Bluetooth
wait-for Turn on to find headphones and speakers
expect-missing Simulated headphones
clean
shot audiobook-bluetooth-off
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Now playing
expect Not connected
tap Play
wait-for Simulated headphones
wait-for Pause
tap Pause
wait-for Play
# The place is kept: chapter two, after a restart.
tap Next chapter
wait-for 2 of 3
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Audiobooks
expect Paused
expect 4 s left
restart
wait-for Audiobooks
expect 4 s left
tap The Quiet Shelf
wait-for Now playing
expect 2 of 3
clean
shot audiobook-resumed
